          explore global AI leadership trends with drill-down capabilities.
        </p>

        <h3>Data &amp; Tools</h3>
        <p>
          Stack: Next.js, D3.js / Chart.js, Python (data pipeline).
          <br />
          Data: OECD AI publications, patent filings, compute benchmarks,
          talent indices across 60+ countries.
        </p>

        <h3>Approach</h3>
        <p>
          • Composite scoring algorithm weighting research, patents, compute,
          and talent.
          <br />• Interactive scatter plots with country-level drill-downs
          and temporal trends.
          <br />• Responsive data visualizations with D3.js and custom
          Chart.js components.
          <br />• Automated data refresh pipeline for quarterly updates.
        </p>

        <h3>Results</h3>
        <p>
          • 60+ countries indexed across 4 composite dimensions.
          <br />• Interactive visualizations with sub-200ms render times.
          <br />• Full responsive design for mobile and desktop.
        </p>

        <h3>Impact</h3>
        <p>
          Provides researchers and policymakers with a data-driven lens into
          global AI competitiveness and R&amp;D investment patterns.
        </p>

        <h3>Links</h3>
